    "detailed_description": "A 90\u2019s nostalgia inspired lo-fi adventure with a relaxing atmosphere and wholesome story, paced between tiny planet platforming and puzzle-solving.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800390/extras/10e18ea488b44b7dc40c8559ddea2e19.avif?t=1735573178\" /></div><br><br>In Astro Pig you play as Buyk, a piglet space cadet, on a mysterious mission through uncharted territory together with his intelligent ship \u2013 talk with the galaxy sector's inhabitants, solve challenges to open up new paths and help him find what he's looking for.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800390/extras/920a4c38f7222a022fcc06be5507763b.poster.avif?t=1735573178\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800390/extras/920a4c38f7222a022fcc06be5507763b.webm?t=1735573178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800390/extras/920a4c38f7222a022fcc06be5507763b.mp4?t=1735573178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800390/extras/b0f9872d60594fd89ab60574f330e95a.avif?t=1735573178\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore <strong>three different worlds</strong> with <strong>dozens of stages</strong> and many <strong>puzzle mechanics</strong>;<br></li><li> <strong>Talk</strong> with many different <strong>NPCs</strong> in a lighthearted, quirky dialogue style;<br></li><li> Unlock <strong>three retro addictive minigames</strong> for your handheld console;<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800390/extras/94c1b454d6800b61aeddb7517117f4e5.poster.avif?t=1735573178\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800390/extras/94c1b454d6800b61aeddb7517117f4e5.webm?t=1735573178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800390/extras/94c1b454d6800b61aeddb7517117f4e5.mp4?t=1735573178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li> Get <strong>Steam Achievements</strong>;<br></li><li> Listen to <strong>over 40 completely original lo-fi tracks</strong>;<br></li><li> And <strong>make your own tracks</strong> with our <strong>Make-a-Beat</strong> system!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800390/extras/09a0bba7059267c2a0d91efa71295c42.poster.avif?t=1735573178\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800390/extras/09a0bba7059267c2a0d91efa71295c42.webm?t=1735573178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800390/extras/09a0bba7059267c2a0d91efa71295c42.mp4?t=1735573178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
    "about_the_game": "A 90\u2019s nostalgia inspired lo-fi adventure with a relaxing atmosphere and wholesome story, paced between tiny planet platforming and puzzle-solving.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800390/extras/10e18ea488b44b7dc40c8559ddea2e19.avif?t=1735573178\" /></div><br><br>In Astro Pig you play as Buyk, a piglet space cadet, on a mysterious mission through uncharted territory together with his intelligent ship \u2013 talk with the galaxy sector's inhabitants, solve challenges to open up new paths and help him find what he's looking for.<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800390/extras/920a4c38f7222a022fcc06be5507763b.poster.avif?t=1735573178\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800390/extras/920a4c38f7222a022fcc06be5507763b.webm?t=1735573178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800390/extras/920a4c38f7222a022fcc06be5507763b.mp4?t=1735573178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800390/extras/b0f9872d60594fd89ab60574f330e95a.avif?t=1735573178\" /></div><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li> Explore <strong>three different worlds</strong> with <strong>dozens of stages</strong> and many <strong>puzzle mechanics</strong>;<br></li><li> <strong>Talk</strong> with many different <strong>NPCs</strong> in a lighthearted, quirky dialogue style;<br></li><li> Unlock <strong>three retro addictive minigames</strong> for your handheld console;<br><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800390/extras/94c1b454d6800b61aeddb7517117f4e5.poster.avif?t=1735573178\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800390/extras/94c1b454d6800b61aeddb7517117f4e5.webm?t=1735573178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800390/extras/94c1b454d6800b61aeddb7517117f4e5.mp4?t=1735573178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br></li><li> Get <strong>Steam Achievements</strong>;<br></li><li> Listen to <strong>over 40 completely original lo-fi tracks</strong>;<br></li><li> And <strong>make your own tracks</strong> with our <strong>Make-a-Beat</strong> system!</li></ul><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800390/extras/09a0bba7059267c2a0d91efa71295c42.poster.avif?t=1735573178\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800390/extras/09a0bba7059267c2a0d91efa71295c42.webm?t=1735573178\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1800390/extras/09a0bba7059267c2a0d91efa71295c42.mp4?t=1735573178\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div>",
